WEBVTT

00:14:57.454 --> 00:15:00.871
as opposed to just like majority views?

00:15:00.871 --> 00:15:09.121
Or how how how do you avoid something
taking us further into the sort of

00:15:09.537 --> 00:15:13.121
the maze of errors and bad thinking
and so forth that has already been

00:15:13.121 --> 00:15:14.537
a worrying feature for the last few years
?

00:15:14.746 --> 00:15:15.829
It's a fantastic question,

00:15:15.829 --> 00:15:20.162
and I think it is the most interesting
area of research that we need to pursue.

00:15:20.162 --> 00:15:21.787
Now, I think at this point,

00:15:22.121 --> 00:15:27.079
the questions of whether we can build
really powerful general-purpose AI system,

00:15:28.412 --> 00:15:29.829
I won't say there in the rearview mirror.

00:15:29.829 --> 00:15:31.829
We still have a lot of hard
engineering work to do,